<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A7" title="In CausalMotion: Structured Physical Reasoning as Keyframe and Trajectory Guidance for Training-Free Video Generation" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">G </span>More qualitative results</span></a></li>
